Tip:</strong> Captura siempre la volva para descartar mortales. El anillo parece estar presente, pero la base es crucial.\n                        </p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 text-on-surface-variant\">\n<button class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 hover:text-primary transition-colors\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]\">chat_bubble</span>\n<span class=\"text-xs font-bold\">14</span>\n</button>\n<button class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 hover:text-primary transition-colors\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]\">verified</span>\n<span class=\"text-xs font-bold\">3 Votos</span>\n</button>\n<button class=\"ml-auto flex items-center gap-1.5 hover:text-primary transition-colors\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]\">share</span>\n</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n</article>\n<!-- Post Card 2 -->\n<article class=\"glass-card rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-lg opacity-90\">\n<div class=\"p-4 flex items-center gap-3\">\n<div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-surface-container-high border border-outline/20 flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden\">\n<img class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\" data-alt=\"A stylized minimalist avatar icon of a hiker in silhouette against a dusky forest background. The lighting is dim with subtle neon moss-green highlights on the edges, reflecting a night-foray PWA aesthetic.\" src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuCk-fqx5A_-Cgc2EOeUHGm4yR0hzo4UDxux8kRmHrrT9aSxuV4TMiwIt23EoTLucj75_XL22kYgwE0Z8ofQjyr67lyYc9dm9U-N8f_fKBZuIC6ilxmNTnlUpS4CMFmjnvxDnoqjXjdlU475N-koGkZjDvTjS66BD7KZTpfDWzQSMyU6TFAWjOM0QY6KV1S-TOJwNq5M3HQpFPwmdoXdw9TjBentcgNEhRO3F73N0buEyqiqqbAvHCKXkIeSYrJwBpKuWOq3fWCElvPT\"/>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h4 class=\"font-bold text-on-surface text-sm\">MicoFan</h4>\n<p class=\"text-xs text-on-surface-variant flex items-center gap-1\">\n                        Hace 45 min <span class=\"w-1 h-1 bg-outline-variant rounded-full\"></span> Valle de Ordesa\n                    </p>\n</div>\n<span class=\"ml-auto material-symbols-outlined text-on-surface-variant\">more_vert</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"h-56 w-full relative\">\n<img class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\" data-alt=\"A stunning field discovery of a large Boletus edulis mushroom emerging from dark, damp soil and pine needles. The cap is a rich chestnut brown with a matte texture, and the lighting is a soft overhead glow that creates a premium, academic feel. The surrounding forest floor is dark and atmospheric, focusing purely on the specimen.\" src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuCiw2wS6BUQxEiWUSKOjdI1k6OLtn2m7j1abbRGnf6rVlOQrlCOIj83YuImkkZGw46rPhEEusOn96SqirzAhHsURVbavFVtp1nOQzE-aAE4oBs2VQkMY6c1e2X9H0iFUfcu69P8K5-k34M00Ve7Uj32RC_1XVLuOPZp-6frla5-w16hg9mTcCRijLLm2eI1QKLaU_tcUsavelNbvSAmGhKV5-dCW7yygM2SLXi8Ggd7KJsC543qO-Tm0u8lxXlkcx5NsI0_R30UEmoS\"/>\n<div class=\"absolute bottom-0 w-full p-4 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80 to-transparent\">\n<div class=\"flex gap-2\">\n<span class=\"bg-primary/20 backdrop-blur-md text-primary text-[10px] px-2 py-1 rounded-full border border-primary/30 uppercase font-bold\">Comestible</span>\n<span class=\"bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-md text-white text-[10px] px-2 py-1 rounded-full border border-white/20 uppercase font-bold\">Excelente</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"p-4\">\n<p class=\"text-on-surface font-body-md mb-2\">Precioso ejemplar encontrado hoy. ┬┐Alguien m├ís por la zona viendo esta explosi├│n?</p>\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 text-on-surface-variant\">\n<button class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 hover:text-primary transition-colors\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]\">favorite</span>\n<span class=\"text-xs font-bold\">32</span>\n</button>\n<button class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 hover:text-primary transition-colors\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]\">chat_bubble</span>\n<span class=\"text-xs font-bold\">8</span>\n</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n</article>\n</main>\n<!-- Bottom Navigation -->\n<nav class=\"fixed bottom-0 w-full z-50 rounded-t-xl backdrop-blur-xl bg-surface-container/60 border-t border-primary/20 shadow-none flex justify-around items-center px-4 py-2 pb-safe\">\n<a class=\"flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-white/5 active:scale-95 transition-all duration-300 px-3 py-1\" href=\"#\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">home</span>\n<span class=\"font-body-md text-[10px]\">Inicio</span>\n</a>\n<a class=\"flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-white/5 active:scale-95 transition-all duration-300 px-3 py-1\" href=\"#\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">center_focus_strong</span>\n<span class=\"font-body-md text-[10px]\">Identificar</span>\n</a>\n<a class=\"flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-white/5 active:scale-95 transition-all duration-300 px-3 py-1\" href=\"#\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">sports_esports</span>\n<span class=\"font-body-md text-[10px]\">Juegos</span>\n</a>\n<a class=\"flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-white/5 active:scale-95 transition-all duration-300 px-3 py-1\" href=\"#\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">menu_book</span>\n<span class=\"font-body-md text-[10px]\">Enciclopedia</span>\n</a>\n<!-- Active State for 'M├ís' / Comunidad -->\n<a class=\"flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-primary bg-primary-container/20 rounded-xl px-3 py-1 active:scale-95 transition-all duration-300\" href=\"#\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\" style=\"font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;\">groups</span>\n<span class=\"font-body-md text-[10px] font-bold\">Comunidad</span>\n</a>\n</nav>\n<!-- Floating Action Button for quick upload (Contextual) -->\n<div class=\"fixed bottom-24 right-6 z-40\">\n<button class=\"w-14 h-14 bg-primary text-on-primary rounded-full shadow-2xl flex items-center justify-center active:scale-90 transition-transform\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[28px]\">photo_camera</span>\n</button>\n</div>\n<script>\n        // Micro-interactions for glass cards\n        document.querySelectorAll('.glass-card').forEach(card => {\n            card.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {\n                const rect = card.getBoundingClientRect();\n                const x = e.clientX - rect.left;\n                const y = e.clientY - rect.top;\n                card.style.setProperty('--mouse-x', `${x}px`);\n                card.style.setProperty('--mouse-y', `${y}px`);\n            });\n        });\n    </script>\n</body></html>"}
